### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### DATA API — Golden Harvest (puerto 8000)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Catálogo de productos
GET http://localhost:8000/products

###

### Clientes
GET http://localhost:8000/customers

###

### Pedidos del mes actual
GET http://localhost:8000/orders?month=2026-06

###

### Estadísticas mensuales
GET http://localhost:8000/stats/monthly?month=2026-06

###

### Carritos abandonados
GET http://localhost:8000/stats/abandoned-carts

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### WORKFLOW 04 — Social Media Content Engine
### Webhook: POST /webhook/social/generate-content
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Generar post para Instagram (formal)
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/social/generate-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "instagram",
  "tone": "formal",
  "product_sku": "ACE-001"
}

###

### Generar post para WhatsApp (casual)
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/social/generate-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "whatsapp",
  "tone": "casual",
  "product_sku": "MER-001"
}

###

### Generar post con producto aleatorio
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/social/generate-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "instagram",
  "tone": "casual"
}

###


