### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### WORKFLOW 07 — Logistics & Shipping Automation
### Webhook: POST /webhook/logistics/shipping-confirm
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Pedido estándar — múltiples productos
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/logistics/shipping-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ORD-2026-001",
  "customer": {
    "name": "Bodega Los Álamos",
    "address": "Ruta 7 Km 1040, Luján de Cuyo, Mendoza",
    "email": "compras@losalamos.com.ar"
  },
  "items": [
    { "sku": "ACE-001", "name": "Aceitunas Negras en Conserva 380g", "qty": 120, "unit": "unidades" },
    { "sku": "CHI-001", "name": "Chutney de Tomate y Albahaca 250g", "qty": 48, "unit": "unidades" },
    { "sku": "PES-001", "name": "Pesto Casero en Aceite de Oliva 190g", "qty": 24, "unit": "unidades" }
  ],
  "confirmed_by": "Carlos Méndez",
  "confirmed_at": "2026-06-16T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### Pedido edge case — ítem único, gran cantidad
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/logistics/shipping-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ORD-2026-002",
  "customer": {
    "name": "Supermercados Norte S.A.",
    "address": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
    "email": "logistica@norte.com.ar"
  },
  "items": [
    { "sku": "MER-001", "name": "Mermelada Artesanal de Higo 300g", "qty": 600, "unit": "unidades" }
  ],
  "confirmed_by": "Ana Ríos",
  "confirmed_at": "2026-06-16T14:30:00Z"
}

###

### Pedido edge case — orden grande mixta
POST http://localhost:4343/webhook/logistics/shipping-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ORD-2026-003",
  "customer": {
    "name": "Distribuidora Del Sur",
    "address": "Ruta Nacional 40, San Rafael, Mendoza",
    "email": "pedidos@delsur.com.ar"
  },
  "items": [
    { "sku": "ACE-001", "name": "Aceitunas Negras en Conserva 380g", "qty": 240, "unit": "unidades" },
    { "sku": "ACE-002", "name": "Aceitunas Verdes Rellenas con Morrón 370g", "qty": 120, "unit": "unidades" },
    { "sku": "CHI-002", "name": "Chutney de Ciruela y Jengibre 250g", "qty": 96, "unit": "unidades" },
    { "sku": "MER-001", "name": "Mermelada Artesanal de Higo 300g", "qty": 48, "unit": "unidades" }
  ],
  "confirmed_by": "Luis Fernández",
  "confirmed_at": "2026-06-16T16:00:00Z"
}

